  "description": "Grumpy Neon Graffiti Duck\nThis duck has zero patience and isn’t afraid to show it!\nWith his bright yellow feathers, angry expression, sideways pink cap and chunky silver chain, he’s got some serious attitude. His arms are crossed, his eyebrows are down, and he looks like he’s had enough of everyone.\nThe neon pink, lime green and orange paint splashes give this design a fun graffiti street art look. Add a few spray-painted crowns and you’ve got one very grumpy duck who clearly thinks he’s the boss.\nThe bright colours really pop against black fabric, making this a great choice for anyone who loves funny characters, urban streetwear and a little sarcasm.\nFILE DETAILS\n– High-resolution PNG\n– 300 DPI\n– Approximately 4200 × 4800 pixels\n– Halftone dot shading for added detail\n– All black removed from the artwork\n– Prepared for black and dark-coloured garments\n– Suitable for DTF and White Toner Transfer printing\nPLEASE NOTE\nThis design has been specially prepared for printing on black or dark-coloured T-shirts.\nAll black has been removed from the artwork, leaving those areas transparent so the fabric colour shows through. The design uses halftone dots to create shading and detail rather than solid black ink.\nFor the intended look, a black T-shirt is recommended. Other dark garment colours will show through the transparent areas and may change the overall appearance.\nNOT SUITABLE FOR SUBLIMATION PRINTING.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Grumpy Neon Graffiti Duck</p>\n<p>This duck has zero patience and isn’t afraid to show it!</p>\n<p>With his bright yellow feathers, angry expression, sideways pink cap and chunky silver chain, he’s got some serious attitude. His arms are crossed, his eyebrows are down, and he looks like he’s had enough of everyone.</p>\n<p>The neon pink, lime green and orange paint splashes give this design a fun graffiti street art look. Add a few spray-painted crowns and you’ve got one very grumpy duck who clearly thinks he’s the boss.</p>\n<p>The bright colours really pop against black fabric, making this a great choice for anyone who loves funny characters, urban streetwear and a little sarcasm.</p>\n<p>FILE DETAILS</p>\n<p>– High-resolution PNG<br>\n– 300 DPI<br>\n– Approximately 4200 × 4800 pixels<br>\n– Halftone dot shading for added detail<br>\n– All black removed from the artwork<br>\n– Prepared for black and dark-coloured garments<br>\n– Suitable for DTF and White Toner Transfer printing</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE</p>\n<p>This design has been specially prepared for printing on black or dark-coloured T-shirts.</p>\n<p>All black has been removed from the artwork, leaving those areas transparent so the fabric colour shows through. The design uses halftone dots to create shading and detail rather than solid black ink.</p>\n<p>For the intended look, a black T-shirt is recommended. Other dark garment colours will show through the transparent areas and may change the overall appearance.</p>\n<p>NOT SUITABLE FOR SUBLIMATION PRINTING.</p>",
